WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
Remember that with our model view octopus paradigm,

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.785
the view and the model should never communicate directly with each other.

00:00:07.785 --> 00:00:11.600
That means, you should have put zero for this one right here,

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.475
and zero for this one right here.

00:00:13.475 --> 00:00:15.300
All the rest of them are fine.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.070
We know that we can go between the view and

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:20.315
the octopus and the octopus in the model, and vice versa.

00:00:20.315 --> 00:00:23.880
Now, if the number that you put in here or here wasn't zero,

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.520
you may want to consider pausing this video and going

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:29.930
back to your code to see if there's a better solution that you can come up with.

